        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Good point—the WezTerm-specific workaround was too narrow. I reworked this to implement the general fallback described in #20706: after terminal-specific patches, missing `tsl`/`fsl` use OSC 0 and BEL for all terminals except hterm. Existing terminfo values remain untouched.\n\nI also rebased onto current `master`. The full `tui_spec.lua` suite passes locally (164 passed, 2 skipped). The prior Zig/Linux failure was an unrelated Codeberg `ProtocolError`; the new push should rerun it.\n",
